    "bounding box" : [ 95.0, 601.0, 562.667, 629.0 ],
    "font" : "Calibri",
    "font size" : 11.04,
    "text color" : "[0.0]",
    "content" : "Split gatekeeping vs technical into different layers: Technical side at the preprint level, suitability for the journal and ethical standards at the journal level."
  }, {
    "type" : "paragraph",
    "pdfua_tag" : "P",
    "id" : 37,
